:34.159" end="00:34.284">a</span> <span begin="00:34.284" end="00:34.512">beat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天啊 我的心为之一颤</span></p><p begin="00:34.612" end="00:37.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:34.612" end="00:34.904">You</span> <span begin="00:34.904" end="00:35.361">spark</span> <span begin="00:35.361" end="00:35.802">my</span> <span begin="00:35.802" end="00:36.828">ignition,</span> <span begin="00:36.828" end="00:37.593">baby</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你点燃我内心的火焰 宝贝</span></p><p begin="00:37.760" end="00:39.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:37.760" end="00:37.927">It's</span> <span begin="00:37.927" end="00:38.188">like</span> <span begin="00:38.188" end="00:38.300">a</span> <span begin="00:38.300" end="00:38.638">dream,</span> <span begin="00:38.638" end="00:38.738">I</span> <span begin="00:38.738" end="00:39.032">can't</span> <span begin="00:39.032" end="00:39.473">believe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像梦境一样 我难以置信</span></p><p begin="00:39.473" end="00:40.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:39.473" end="00:39.602">You</span> <span begin="00:39.602" end="00:39.738">got</span> <span begin="00:39.738" end="00:39.935">me</span> <span begin="00:39.935" end="00:40.449">blushing</span> <span begin="00:40.449" end="00:40.816">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你再一次令我的脸颊泛着红晕</span></p><p begin="00:40.816" end="00:42.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:40.816" end="00:40.951">Feels</span> <span begin="00:40.951" end="00:41.175">like</span> <span begin="00:41.175" end="00:41.357">the</span> <span begin="00:41.357" end="00:41.839">weather</span> <span begin="00:41.839" end="00:41.964">in</span> <span begin="00:41.964" end="00:42.174">my</span> <span begin="00:42.174" end="00:42.486">hometown</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉好像我家乡的天气一样</span></p><p begin="00:42.486" end="00:43.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:42.486" end="00:42.618">I</span> <span begin="00:42.618" end="00:42.802">can’t</span> <span begin="00:42.802" end="00:43.031">seem</span> <span begin="00:43.031" end="00:43.260">to</span> <span begin="00:43.260" end="00:43.804">forget</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎无法忘记</span></p><p begin="00:43.904" end="00:46.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:43.904" end="00:44.118">Baby,</span> <span begin="00:44.118" end="00:44.393">don't</span> <span begin="00:44.393" end="00:44.658">you</span> <span begin="00:44.658" end="00:44.887">know</span> <span begin="00:44.887" end="00:45.155">that</span> <span begin="00:45.155" end="00:45.503">I'm</span> <span begin="00:45.503" end="00:45.726">so</span> <span begin="00:45.726" end="00:46.243">addicted</span> <span begin="00:46.243" end="00:46.393">to</span> <span begin="00:46.393" end="00:46.621">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 你是否知道我已对你神魂颠倒</span></p><p begin="00:46.621" end="00:49.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:46.621" end="00:47.066">Locked</span> <span begin="00:47.066" end="00:47.407">up</span> <span begin="00:47.407" end="00:47.734">in</span> <span begin="00:47.734" end="00:48.106">the</span> <span begin="00:48.106" end="00:48.477">words</span> <span begin="00:48.477" end="00:48.771">you</span> <span begin="00:48.771" end="00:49.219">say</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉醉于你的一言一句之中</span></p><p begin="00:49.219" end="00:58.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:49.219" end="00:49.880">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:49.880" end="00:50.506">I</span> <span begin="00:50.506" end="00:51.116">can't</span> <span begin="00:51.116" end="00:51.698">let</span> <span begin="00:51.698" end="00:52.478">it</span> <span begin="00:52.478" end="00:53.631">go,</span> <span begin="00:53.631" end="00:54.205">no</span> <span begin="00:54.205" end="00:55.686">other</span> <span begin="00:55.686" end="00:58.123">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我无法放手 别无选择</span></p><p begin="00:58.123" end="01:00.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:58.123" end="00:58.404">Day</span> <span begin="00:58.404" end="00:58.685">or</span> <span begin="00:58.685" end="00:59.027">night,</span> <span begin="00:59.027" end="00:59.147">I</span> <span begin="00:59.147" end="00:59.388">just</span> <span begin="00:59.388" end="00:59.698">need</span> <span begin="00:59.698" end="01:00.011">you</span> <span begin="01:00.011" end="01:00.267">to</span> <span begin="01:00.267" end="01:00.652">stay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论昼夜 我只需要你留下来</span></p><p begin="00:59.918" end="01:05.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:59.918" end="01:00.346">'Cause</span> <span begin="01:00.346" end="01:00.625">I'm</span> <span begin="01:00.625" end="01:00.901">in</span> <span begin="01:00.901" end="01:01.371">love</span> <span begin="01:01.371" end="01:01.713">with</span> <span begin="01:01.713" end="01:05.202">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我对你一往情深</span></p><p begin="01:05.902" end="01:11.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:05.902" end="01:06.442">Obsessed</span> <span begin="01:06.442" end="01:06.922">with</span> <span begin="01:06.922" end="01:07.538">only</span> <span begin="01:07.538" end="01:11.299">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为你心醉神迷</span></p><p begin="01:13.136" end="01:14.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:13.136" end="01:13.424">When</span> <span begin="01:13.424" end="01:13.892">enough</span> <span begin="01:13.892" end="01:14.254">ain’t</span> <span begin="01:14.254" end="01:14.709">enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我欲罢不能</span></p><p begin="01:14.709" end="01:16.209" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:14.709" end="01:14.875">Got</span> <sp