span> <span begin="01:30.218" end="01:30.541">hit</span> <span begin="01:30.541" end="01:30.696">the</span> <span begin="01:30.696" end="01:31.250">ground</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说你做好准备 这样就不会突然摔倒在地</span></p><p begin="01:30.929" end="01:32.723" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:30.929" end="01:31.102">I</span> <span begin="01:31.102" end="01:31.525">swear</span> <span begin="01:31.525" end="01:31.625">we</span> <span begin="01:31.625" end="01:31.986">about</span> <span begin="01:31.986" end="01:32.086">to</span> <span begin="01:32.086" end="01:32.272">move</span> <span begin="01:32.272" end="01:32.372">a</span> <span begin="01:32.372" end="01:32.723">mountain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓我们即将移动山岳</span></p><p begin="01:32.723" end="01:34.205" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:32.723" end="01:32.970">Keep</span> <span begin="01:32.970" end="01:33.217">your</span> <span begin="01:33.217" end="01:33.345">eyes</span> <span begin="01:33.345" end="01:33.445">on</span> <span begin="01:33.445" end="01:33.878">that</span> <span begin="01:33.878" end="01:34.205">track</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">目不转睛地盯着那道踪迹</span></p><p begin="01:34.205" end="01:35.714" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:34.205" end="01:34.474">And</span> <span begin="01:34.474" end="01:34.591">you</span> <span begin="01:34.591" end="01:34.852">know</span> <span begin="01:34.852" end="01:35.067">I’ll</span> <span begin="01:35.067" end="01:35.183">be</span> <span begin="01:35.183" end="01:35.428">here</span> <span begin="01:35.428" end="01:35.714">waiting</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我会在原地等待</span></p><p begin="01:35.714" end="01:37.563" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:35.714" end="01:35.945">Just</span> <span begin="01:35.945" end="01:36.077">to</span> <span begin="01:36.077" end="01:36.268">show</span> <span begin="01:36.268" end="01: